ude of all members of the council  this morning was constructive I think  for all countries it was underlined that  we are now going into the direction of  having a very competent strategy because  it involves all elements that are  important to manage the flow of refugees  that is to say a diamond with Turkey the  second one is the solidarity towards  surgeries the third is the whole issue  of ways through ending of the waves  through I should say and the balcon  route and the fourth element is  intra-european solidarity to ensure that  is a voluntary resettlement program from  Greece and Turkey
 

